FailedMount` 事件，可能由 PVC 未绑定、StorageClass 缺失或 Secret/ConfigMap 不存在引起。\"}, {\"scenario\": \"镜像拉取失败\", \"probability\": \"medium\", \"reason\": \"`ContainerCreating` 也可能是由于镜像拉取超时或凭证问题导致，尽管通常会有 `ImagePullBackOff` 等后续状态，但初期可能停留在此状态。\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCreating\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\", \"name\": \"workload\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"ContainerCreating 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-volume-mount-failed.md\"]}], \"issue_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"ContainerCreating\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v05\", \"name\": \"workload\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"ContainerCreating 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-volume-mount-failed.md\"]}], \"current_abnormal_summary\": {\"source\": \"kubectl_get_by_name\", \"status_counts\": {\"ContainerCreating\": 1}, \"total_abnormal\": 1, \"selected_rows\": [\"workload   0/1     ContainerCreating   0          20m   <none>   node2   <none>           <none>            aiops.lab/case-id=v05,app.kubernetes.io/name=workload\"], \"raw_ref\": \"/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3ead84b026244229/tools/007-layer-kubectl_get_by_name.raw.txt\", \"summary_ref\": \"/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3ead84b026244229/tools/007-layer-kubectl_get_by_name.summary.txt\", \"structured_ref\": \"/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3ead84b026244229/tools/007-layer-kubectl_get_by_name.structured.json\"}}", "key_entities": [{"type": "pod", "name": "workload", "namespace": "aiops-case-v05