data: {"id": "3ead84b026244229-thinking-parallel_evidence-1030", "run_id": "3ead84b026244229", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 根因证据总结\n\n通过对 `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的多维度工具采集，证据链完整且指向一致：\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 | 作用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Kubernetes Describe** | Event: `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` | **直接根因**：明确指出挂载失败的具体原因 |\n| **Kubernetes YAML** | Volumes 定义: `input: configMap: workload-input` | **配置对照**：确认 Pod 确实引用了该 ConfigMap 作为卷 |\n| **Kubernetes ConfigMap** | ConfigMap `workload-input` 存在，但 data 中**仅有 `available-key`**，没有 `unavailable-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789123026421, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

